WEBVTT

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:06.215
Which reports you see depends on your role.

00:00:06.215 --> 00:00:09.498
Under Roles, search the permissions for reports.

00:00:09.498 --> 00:00:15.334
View Contact Center reports opens the Contact Center reports, and View Omnichannel reports

00:00:15.334 --> 00:00:17.826
opens the CRM and campaign reports.

00:00:18.355 --> 00:00:24.387
Another report can bring a permission of its own, such as Run Phone Number Verifications Report.

00:00:24.387 --> 00:00:27.285
Give a role only the ones its members need.

00:00:28.985 --> 00:00:34.538
This is the Reports page of a user whose role has only View Contact Center reports.

00:00:34.538 --> 00:00:40.215
The Contact Center reports are listed; the CRM reports, such as Lead funnel, are not.

